  "bodyText": "Church Connect\n\nThe Church Connect App is available for download on both Android and iOS.\n\nNeed Help?\n\nInstructions Below. Contact us for the code.\n\nConnect with First Baptist Muncie through Church Connect mobile app and web experience—an online space where you can explore, engage, and get involved.\n\nSee Wednesday weekly news, register for events, get updates, see our calendar, give online, easily contact the church, and much more.\n\nThis app is free and the information is secure to only those inside of the First Baptist family.\n\n[Button] Click Here -> mailto:office@fbcmuncie.org?subject=Church%20Connect%20App",
